config DRM_APPLE_SGX
	tristate "Apple S5L8940X PowerVR SGX543MP2"
	depends on DRM
	depends on ARCH_APPLE_S5L || COMPILE_TEST
	depends on COMMON_CLK && OF
	select DRM_GEM_SHMEM_HELPER
	select DRM_SCHED
	help
	  The GPU of the Apple A5 (S5L8940X/8942X), a PowerVR SGX543MP2.
	  Switches it on with the initialisation iOS runs, starts iOS's GPU
	  microkernel (from /lib/firmware/apple/sgx543.fw, which the user
	  takes out of their own IPSW), and offers a render node for Mesa
	  and sgx2d: GEM buffers in the GPU's address space and renders
	  queued to the microkernel.  Also a 2D engine that can draw fbcon's
	  fills and copies, and research tools in debugfs (apple-sgx/).

	  The render node's interface is experimental and will change.

	  If unsure, say N.
